v0.5.3.0

Format: v0.STAGE.RELEASE.FEATURE
  STAGE  = 5 = Editor maduro + RTC + timer + repeat rate + shell line editing + 
                history + PATH + redirection + syntax highlight + undo + clipboard
  RELEASE = 3 = autocomplete (TAB), line numbers toggle (F2), keyboard ISR fix,
                env vars, aliases, PS1 prompt, timestamps in ls/stat, 
                graceful shutdown + reboot, scripting (source), $? exit code,
                terminal colorido (colors.h), PS1 escape expansion (\w, \W, \u, \h, \s, \$),
                diretório atual no prompt, cd .. / cd . suporte documentado
  FEATURE = 0 = initial feature set
